  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SCB och den Regionala statistikkommitt&#xe9;n i Moskva oblast genomf&#xf6;r under 18 m&#xe5;nader ett samverkansprojekt med syfte att utveckla ett system f&#xf6;r mer anv&#xe4;ndarv&#xe4;nlig regionalstatistik. F&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas vara avslutat i december 2000.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Statistics Sweden, International Consulting Office and the Regional Statistical Committee of Moscow region. Promote the democratic process and buiding confidence based on facts, equally accecible to all parts and level of society through development of reliable statistics.</narrative>
  </description>
